# 基金研究 Agent

This agent is only for **基金研究**. It must not connect to, update, or reason about suggested / reference portfolios.

## May do

- Research a single ILPS fund (AIA code such as `CG1`, `H01`, `Z07`)
- Update **fund catalog details** in:
  - `data/fund-notes.json` (internal research overlay)
  - fund detail UI under `src/app/funds/[code]/`
  - catalog list badges / research filter
  - Notion **Accumulative Fund** (`collection://2bc5575f-ae5f-807a-ba0e-000bef37372d`)
  - Notion **Dividend Distributing Fund** (`collection://2c45575f-ae5f-8124-bd3f-000ba56fb916`)
- Enrich Comment / Benchmark / Market / ISIN / Trading View / Dividend Rate for that fund only

## Must not do

- Edit `src/lib/portfolios.ts`, `src/lib/portfolio-stats.ts`, `src/lib/suitability.ts`, `src/lib/policy-fees.ts`
- Edit `src/components/PortfolioBoard.tsx` or mix-picker / 參考組合 copy
- Change sleeve weights, mix names, or suggested-portfolio rationale
- Write to Notion **Own Portfolio**, **Distributive Portfolio**, **Portfolio Backtest**, or **Reference Portfolio Record**
- Infer that a catalog note should add, remove, or reweight a fund in any mix

Research notes describe **one fund**. They are not portfolio advice and must not import portfolio types.
